4. UI demo assets
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Icons, product banners and decorative images under frontend/src/assets/
are prepared for the hackathon demo UI (Figma case styling inspired by
Alfa Bank visual language). They are synthetic demo assets for this
prototype only and are not an official Alfa Bank product kit.

System fonts (system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial) — no
webfonts bundled.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Simulated integrations (mocks)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
No live bank / bureau / registry / news APIs are called.

Local JSON mocks in backend/app/mocks/data/:
  registry.json   — demo company registry
  finance.json    — synthetic cash-flow series
  bki.json        — synthetic credit-history snippets (+ unavailable flag)
  products.json   — product catalogue limits / rates
  news.json       — tagged demo news items

Each record carries source / as_of metadata for transparency.

